Studied the rigid mechanics examples and pendulum demo for the scene ideas.
Physics Play implements its vector drawings, projectile and spring formulas,
nonlinear pendulum, and disk and domino contact models in Rust. No manim-physics
source, artwork, Python, Manim or pymunk is incorporated.

WASM feasibility spike
Rapier (rapier2d 0.36.1, commit 3406750a38286a0d3c7d0f4be2f9d53153e81d90)
https://github.com/dimforge/rapier/tree/v0.36.1
Apache License 2.0.

Evaluated Rapier with enhanced-determinism for disk and domino contacts in the
AniMathIO WASM sandbox. The prototype built and rendered short scenes, but
trapped when replaying its largest 30-second scenes. The released component
uses an original bounded solver and neither bundles nor links Rapier or Parry.
